Z||000007||Galen||07-10-2001||10:17 PM||||I second the dont gopostal on em, Just act a little weird, like, pink hair.. purple Eyelashes...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/redcreature.gif">   <BR><FONT SIZE="1">To whom it may concern, The preceeding message was the opinion of this person and not of this forum. If you do not like it. Oh well</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000008||AusFiero||07-11-2001||11:07 AM||||On the rumours Lisa tell em to get stuffed. <P>My best friend is a single female and I am married. We go out and shoot pool, talk and generally have fun like friends do. My wife has no problem with that, others do. In fact it shows my wife trusts me and respects my decisions and choices in friends which is great. <P>People who are rumour mongers are not worth knowing.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
