Z||000010||Slammed Fiero||07-11-2001||11:50 AM||||Call up Chuck , get him to lay the smack down. Don't be ashamed to use your dads position of power  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I do it all the time to get out of lots of stuff. (ie speeding)<P>PS Lance just drove by my room ...car is as cheezy as ever. He got fired from the chrysler dealer and cried.<P>sorry inside joke.. <P>Just roll with the ****  Lisa. I know it sucks ass, but sometimes it happens. I know you won't be making as much money. But just go with it. it's not like you will be working there when you go back to school. Perhaps next summer try to get a corp job. Thats where the perks are (haha)<P>JM ||||reg||1
