Z||000013||Ken Wittlief||07-11-2001||01:51 PM||||maybe the reason they put you in the other store is so you can work you magic there - and teach the other sales people there how its done<P> if the store is in a bad market area and its hard to sell stuff there - then they should close the store<P> maybe thats why you are there - if you cant sell at that location maybe the store will get the axe.||||reg||1
