Z||000016||bHooper||07-11-2001||04:51 PM||||Lisa, Lisa, Lisa... causing trouble again!?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>jk<P>Hey, Melinda and I were wandering if you wanted to get together and do something sometime?  Email me or call the house... I have clas tonight, but Melidna should be around.<P>besides, you never got to see teh black car, or the part collection!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Red</B></FONT></FONT> 86 GT 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><B>Black</B></FONT> <u>86 SE Automatic</u>||||reg||1
Z||000017||kslish||07-11-2001||06:11 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>That sucks Lisa. Now you know why were engaged    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> thats made my life u know where, much more bearable. On another note, think you might be going to Pittsburg on th 21st?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Roger, Roger, Roger....when are you going to learn that it's Pittsburgh, with an "h" at the end?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>For anyone wondering about the event Roger's referring to, check out the following post:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum7/HTML/000023.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum7/HTML/000023.html</A> <P>Oh yeah Roger, there is a Hooter's close by on the South Side.....maybe a dinner spot?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>fierojunky, if you drop by or come to the event, maybe I can finally get that coupe trunk divider off of you (if you still have it of course).  I still want it.<P>To keep this on topic, Lisa, don't go to Dad for any assistance in this matter other than advice...that's an easy way out that only ends up in giving the rumormongering jerks more ammo.  Just prove to them that you are above all this small talk....<P>Lisa's "other" future husband,   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Ken S.<p>[This message has been edited by kslish (edited 07-11-2001).]||||reg||1
